From 498cba86ae87658c57da191bbc5a8d230aa9d42b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:18:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] carriersettings: map samsung cs fallback errors to cs
 retry

samsung's ims stack redials over cs when the network answers an invite
with one of the operator's voice_csfb_error_code_list codes, e.g. 503
on mobifone. the pixel configs have no such mapping, so these calls
just end.

translate each operator's list into ims_reasoninfo_mapping_string_array
entries that remap the matching sip reason codes, and the not
registered code our ims stack reports after a 503, to
CODE_LOCAL_CALL_CS_RETRY_REQUIRED. busy, cancelled and rejected stay
as they are, and existing mappings are kept.
